---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Author Preview" description="A browser-local Markdown and LaTeX preview workspace for Yu Zhehao." active="journal" noindex={true}>
  <div class="page-shell author-preview-shell">
    <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">首页</a><span>/</span><a href="https://app.pagescms.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Author Studio</a><span>/</span>写作预览台</div>
    <header class="page-heading">
      <p class="page-kicker">AUTHOR STUDIO / LIVE PREVIEW</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">写作预览台</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">左侧写 Markdown 与 LaTeX，右侧实时呈现读者看到的文章。内容只在当前浏览器标签页中处理，不会自动上传或保存到服务器。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="author-preview-notice"><span class="author-preview-pulse"></span><span>LOCAL PREVIEW · 本地预览</span><span class="author-preview-notice-detail">不会发布文章，也不会修改 GitHub 仓库</span></div>

    <section class="author-metadata" aria-label="Article metadata">
      <label class="author-field author-field-title"><span>文章标题 / TITLE</span><input id="author-title" type="text" value="从图到参数积分" autocomplete="off" /></label>
      <label class="author-field author-field-description"><span>摘要 / DESCRIPTION</span><textarea id="author-description" rows="2">用一个简单例子展示如何在文章中编写数学公式，并检查最终排版。</textarea></label>
      <div class="author-field-grid">
        <label class="author-field"><span>内容类型 / TYPE</span><select id="author-kind"><option value="journal">文章 / Journal</option><option value="note">笔记 / Note</option></select></label>
        <label class="author-field"><span>语言 / LANGUAGE</span><select id="author-language"><option value="zh">中文</option><option value="en">English</option></select></label>
        <label class="author-field"><span>文章 ID / TRANSLATION KEY</span><input id="author-key" type="text" value="graph-to-parametric-integrals" spellcheck="false" /></label>
        <label class="author-field"><span>日期 / DATE</span><input id="author-date" type="date" value="2026-11-13" /></label>
        <label class="author-field author-note-only" hidden><span>笔记分类 / CATEGORY</span><input id="author-category" type="text" value="MATHEMATICAL PHYSICS" /></label>
        <label class="author-field"><span>标签 / TAGS</span><input id="author-tags" type="text" value="Feynman integrals, LaTeX, QFT" /></label>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="author-preview-toolbar">
      <div class="author-preview-toolbar-label"><span class="page-kicker">COMPOSER</span><span id="author-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">实时预览已就绪</span></div>
      <div class="author-preview-actions">
        <button class="button button-quiet" id="author-reset" type="button">恢复示例</button>
        <button class="button button-quiet" id="author-copy" type="button">复制正文</button>
        <button class="button button-primary" id="author-download" type="button">下载 Markdown ↧</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="author-preview-workspace">
      <section class="author-editor-panel">
        <div class="author-panel-heading"><div><span class="author-panel-kicker">01 / SOURCE</span><h2>Markdown & LaTeX</h2></div><span class="author-panel-hint">SOURCE MODE</span></div>
        <textarea id="author-source" class="author-source" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Markdown and LaTeX source">## 从图到参数积分

设 \(G\) 是一个连通图，边集为 \(E\)。为每条边引入 Schwinger 参数 \(\alpha_e\)。

第一 Symanzik 多项式由生成树求和：

$$
\mathcal U_G(\alpha)
=
\sum_&#123;T\in\mathcal T_1(G)&#125;
\prod_&#123;e\notin T&#125;\alpha_e.
$$

例如，参数多项式的结构会直接反映图的生成树组合。

我们也可以写行内公式，例如 $\mathcal F_G(\alpha)$、$\zeta(3)$ 和 $\beta(g)$。

## 矩阵与分段公式

$$
M =
\begin&#123;pmatrix&#125;
a & b \\
c & d
\end&#123;pmatrix&#125;,
\qquad
\det M = ad-bc.
$$

## 代码

&#96;&#96;&#96;python
def symanzik_example(edges):
    return "graph data"
&#96;&#96;&#96;

> 提醒：数值验证可以帮助发现规律，但不能替代一般证明。
</textarea>
        <div class="author-editor-footer"><span>支持 Markdown、列表、引用、代码块与 LaTeX</span><span id="author-count">0 字符</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="author-reader-panel">
        <div class="author-panel-heading"><div><span class="author-panel-kicker">02 / READER VIEW</span><h2>读者视图</h2></div><span class="author-panel-hint">LIVE · KATEX</span></div>
        <article class="author-reader-paper">
          <div class="author-reader-meta"><span id="reader-kind">JOURNAL</span><span id="reader-date">2026-11-13</span><span id="reader-language">ZH</span></div>
          <h1 id="reader-title">从图到参数积分</h1>
          <p id="reader-description" class="author-reader-description">用一个简单例子展示如何在文章中编写数学公式，并检查最终排版。</p>
          <div id="reader-tags" class="card-tags"></div>
          <div id="reader-content" class="prose author-reader-content"></div>
        </article>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="author-preview-help">
      <div><p class="page-kicker">PUBLISHING WORKFLOW</p><h2>预览满意后，如何正式发布？</h2></div>
      <ol>
        <li>点击「下载 Markdown」，得到带有 frontmatter 的完整文章文件。</li>
        <li>在 Pages CMS 的 Articles & Journal 或 Notes 中创建对应条目，使用相同的 ID、语言和元数据。</li>
        <li>切换到 Source 模式，把左侧正文复制进去；也可以直接把下载的文件提交到对应内容目录。</li>
        <li>先保持草稿状态。中英文版本都准备好后，再一起发布。</li>
      </ol>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="https://app.pagescms.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">打开 Pages CMS ↗</a>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/markdown-it@14.1.0/dist/markdown-it.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.22/dist/katex.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/markdown-it-texmath@1.0.0/texmath.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/dompurify@3.2.6/dist/purify.min.js"></script>
  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
      const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
      const fields = ['author-title','author-description','author-kind','author-language','author-key','author-date','author-category','author-tags','author-source'];
      const sample = $('author-source').value;
      const requiredLibraries = ['markdownit','katex','texmath','DOMPurify'];
      const missing = requiredLibraries.filter((name) => !window[name]);
      if (missing.length) {
        $('author-status').textContent = '预览引擎加载失败：' + missing.join(', ') + '。请检查网络后刷新。';
        $('reader-content').textContent = '数学与 Markdown 预览库未能加载。你的源文本仍保留在左侧。';
        return;
      }

      const markdown = window.markdownit({ html: false, linkify: true, typographer: false, breaks: false })
        .use(window.texmath, {
          engine: window.katex,
          delimiters: 'dollars',
          katexOptions: { throwOnError: false, trust: false, strict: 'ignore' }
        });

      function update() {
        const title = $('author-title').value.trim() || 'Untitled';
        const description = $('author-description').value.trim();
        const kind = $('author-kind').value;
        const lang = $('author-language').value;
        const tags = $('author-tags').value.split(',').map((item) => item.trim()).filter(Boolean);
        $('reader-title').textContent = title;
        $('reader-description').textContent = description;
        $('reader-kind').textContent = kind === 'note' ? 'NOTE' : 'JOURNAL';
        $('reader-date').textContent = $('author-date').value || '';
        $('reader-language').textContent = lang.toUpperCase();
        $('reader-tags').replaceChildren(...tags.map((tag) => {
          const element = document.createElement('span');
          element.className = 'tag';
          element.textContent = tag;
          return element;
        }));
        const rendered = markdown.render($('author-source').value);
        $('reader-content').innerHTML = window.DOMPurify.sanitize(rendered, { USE_PROFILES: { html: true } });
        $('author-count').textContent = $('author-source').value.length.toLocaleString() + ' 字符';
        document.querySelectorAll('.author-note-only').forEach((node) => { node.hidden = kind !== 'note'; });
      }

      function yamlString(value) { return JSON.stringify(String(value ?? '')); }

      function makeMarkdownFile() {
        const key = $('author-key').value.trim().toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9-]+/g, '-').replace(/^-+|-+$/g, '') || 'untitled';
        const lang = $('author-language').value;
        const tags = $('author-tags').value.split(',').map((item) => item.trim()).filter(Boolean);
        const kind = $('author-kind').value;
        const lines = [
          '---',
          'translationKey: ' + key,
          'lang: ' + lang,
          'title: ' + yamlString($('author-title').value),
          'description: ' + yamlString($('author-description').value),
          'date: ' + ($('author-date').value || new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)),
          'tags: [' + tags.map(yamlString).join(', ') + ']',
          'draft: true'
        ];
        if (kind === 'note') {
          lines.push('category: ' + yamlString($('author-category').value || 'GENERAL'));
          lines.push('order: 100');
        }
        lines.push('---', '', $('author-source').value, '');
        return { filename: key + '.' + lang + '.md', content: lines.join('\n') };
      }

      async function copyText(value, success) {
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
          $('author-status').textContent = success;
        } catch (_) {
          $('author-status').textContent = '浏览器不允许自动复制，请手动选择文本。';
        }
      }

      fields.forEach((id) => $(id).addEventListener('input', update));
      $('author-reset').addEventListener('click', () => {
        $('author-source').value = sample;
        update();
        $('author-status').textContent = '示例内容已恢复';
      });
      $('author-copy').addEventListener('click', () => copyText($('author-source').value, '正文已复制'));
      $('author-download').addEventListener('click', () => {
        const file = makeMarkdownFile();
        const blob = new Blob([file.content], { type: 'text/markdown;charset=utf-8' });
        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        const link = document.createElement('a');
        link.href = url;
        link.download = file.filename;
        document.body.appendChild(link);
        link.click();
        link.remove();
        setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 1000);
        $('author-status').textContent = '已生成 ' + file.filename + '（草稿）';
      });
      update();
    })();
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
